         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The LP2950 and LP2951 are micropower voltage regulators that are specifically designed to maintain proper regulation with an extremely low input‚àíto‚àíoutput voltage differential.</rdf:li>
